      "writtenOn": "2025-05-19T23:00:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "__GFP_CMA exists in 6.12, however do_swap_page() in 6.12 changed and this change from previous version of this patch: https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/kernel/common/+/3009322/16/mm/memory.c#3796 is not ported into this patch. I think as a result, swap-in pages will not be allowed to use CMA for allocations. I don\u0027t know how big of a problem this would be, that\u0027s why I asked you to review this change.",
      "parentUuid": "d352ebe3_c71f140d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 14
