      "writtenOn": "2025-05-19T23:12:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for clarification, Suren.\n\nWe should allow swap-in pages to be allocated to movable space(CMA or movable zones) since anonymous memory are top consumer in Android. Otherwise, more reclaim/compaction activity and premature OOM.",
      "parentUuid": "fb8cd7d4_55f33435",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 27,
        "endChar": 14
